<title>AUSTRALIA: Country Road says Wooltru buys 15 pct stake.</title>
<headline>Country Road says Wooltru buys 15 pct stake.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Upmarket clothing and homewares retailer Country Road Ltd said on Thursday that South African retailer Wooltru Ltd had acquired a 14.86 percent stake in the company.</p>
<p>In a substantial shareholder notice to the Australian Stock Exchange (ASX), the company said Wooltru had acquired 7.7 million shares on April 22.</p>
</text>
